{"id":"5710","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5710_main_stratocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-undulatus-radiatus-with-cumulus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图为典型的灰色层积云层，相对均匀的云底与成层云种有关。可看到一些与层状层积云有关的云类。此云在连续云层中，很<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">厚且很蔽光，可遮挡太阳的位置</span>，这表明是蔽光云类。此外，由于此云是由呈近乎平行排列的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">凸起、波状卷轴</span>组成，因此，它也是波状云类。此外，由于透视效果，这些云线或<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">条带似乎汇聚</span>向地平线上的一个点，形成辐辏云类。在远处我们还可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎积云破碎的边缘</span>，更有序的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">淡积云</span>以及少量的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">低云底层积云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Matthew Clark","location":"英国，德文郡，埃克塞特","latitude":"纬度: 50° 43' 38'' N","longitude":"经度: 3° 28' 36'' W","date":"22 February 2011 1340 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"CL= 8, CM= /, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.7.27","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.7.27"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5710_syn_stratocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-undulatus-radiatus-with-cumulus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>1200 UTC地面分析显示出俄罗斯上空的强烈高压，在大西洋中部962 hPa的深低压。在它们之间，缓慢移动的弱锋正在影响着英国，在图片拍摄地附近有锢囚。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5710_upper_stratocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-undulatus-radiatus-with-cumulus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>1200 UTC从英国英格兰拉克希尔进行了探测（WMO 03743），地点在图片拍摄地东东北130公里。探测结果显示出从地面到低层大气趋于饱和，直到急剧逆温达到800 hPa（大约2000米）时为止。由于云的蔽光性，层积云底可能在逆温下方几十米。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5710_sat_stratocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-undulatus-radiatus-with-cumulus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>在1200 UTC Meteosat红外卫星云图上，红箭头指向的是图片拍摄位置。英国英格兰德文郡上空的浅灰色表示相对较暖的云顶温度，有利于估算的约2000米（6200英尺）云顶高度。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2011","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4386_main_cumulus-and-stratocumulus-with-bases-at-different-levels_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>一排小型的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积云</span>与更高层的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层积云</span>同时出现。在微弱的地表气流下，正降落着大滴的轻微但持续的雨。</p>\n<p>该地区主要受冷空气的上坡输送和科罗拉多高原上升气流的影响。</p></div>","copyright":"© R.F. Reinking","location":"Niwot, Colorado, United States of America","latitude":"纬度: 40° 6' 14'' N","longitude":"经度: 105° 10' 15'' W","date":"10 June 1986 1830 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 8, CM= /, CH= /","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}